{
  "_comment": [
    "Where each asset comes from. Generated by the scratch tool that reads",
    "docs/MODELS.md and the installed packs' own git remotes - not typed.",
    "",
    "models: filename -> { folder, sizeGb, source }",
    "  source.type \"huggingface\" carries a repo id; the fetcher finds the",
    "  file inside it by name, so no path has to be guessed.",
    "  source.type \"manual\" means the origin was never recorded: the fetcher",
    "  says so and points at docs/MODELS.md rather than inventing a URL.",
    "packs: folder name -> { git, ref } or { registry, version }, or { manual: why }",
    "  ref / version pin the pack; pinned.tested says whether the flows were",
    "  run against that version (from the ComfyUI machine) or it is simply the",
    "  upstream head on pinned.on. Refresh with install/lib/pin-assets.js.",
    "  manual: no public source; the note says how to get it.",
    "models: a huggingface source also carries revision, sha256 and bytes once",
    "  pinned; fetch-model.py downloads that revision and checks the hash."
  ],
